              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "just_jam"
            },
            "reviewBody": "this was awesome with some minor modifications.. i subbed apple cider vinegar for the malt, left out the water and added a splash of olive oil and a couple of tablespoons of sour orange juice.. blended everything and used this as a marinade for cubed up chicken breasts for kabobs.. heated up the marinade afterwards and returned the finished kabobs to coat.. i am so looking forward to making this again.. ty for the recipe",
