              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Buckwheat Queen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a smooth yet spicy sauce. To keep it gluten free I had to use a gluten free Chinese black vinegar instead of malt vinegar. It has a malty, smoky flavour but accented the habanero in a way like no other. Thank you for the recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-18T06:48:09.163Z"
