            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "madelennon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just tried this and it was great! We are huge sauce people. (sauces are half of our fridge) This was super easy and just the right amount of kick! And thank you to Chris for reminding about the gloves. I always forget and am miserable for about 8 hours!",
